</tbody></table><p>Cart synchronization validates all items before replacing the cart. Prices come from the server. Checkout reserves stock atomically. Repeating checkout with the same UUID and address/coupon returns the original order; different details return 409. Keep the same UUID when retrying a checkout.</p><p>Monetary totals use integer cents. Responses: 200 read/update, 201 token/order creation, 204 token deletion, 401 unauthenticated, 403 forbidden, 404 missing, 409 idempotency conflict, 422 invalid input, 429 rate limited.</p><p>Vendors see and process only their own order lines. Customers see only their own orders. Admin web CRUD is at <code>/manage/users</code>, <code>/manage/categories</code>, <code>/manage/products</code>, and <code>/manage/coupons</code>.</p></div>
